    {
      "market": "France",
      "title": "Baignoire and Myst de Cartier",
      "uri": "the-eye-of-the-jeweller",
      "slug": "the-eye-of-the-jeweller",
      "type": "product",
      "loaded": 1,
      "watchSceneIndex": 2,
      "content": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heroBlock",
            "title": "Baignoire and Myst de Cartier",
            "subtitle": "The eye of the jeweller"
          },
          {
            "type": "scrollMediasBlock",
            "text": "Cartier's mastery of watchmaking also draws its inventiveness and vitality from its jewellery savoir-faire; shapes are made sublime with a motif or stone-setting.",
            "medias": [
              {
                "url": "/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock1.webp",
                "ariaLabel": "",
                "subtitle": "Studded with clous de Paris"
              },
              {
                "url": "/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock2.webp",
                "ariaLabel": "",
                "subtitle": "The motif adds rhythm and structure"
              },
              {
                "url": "/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock3.webp",
                "ariaLabel": "",
                "subtitle": "A sensorial wearing experience"
              },
              {
                "url": "/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock4.webp",
                "ariaLabel": "",
                "subtitle": "Entirely polished by hand"
              },
              {
                "url": "/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock5.webp",
                "ariaLabel": "",
                "subtitle": "The emblematic oval watch"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "scrollWatchBlock",
            "texts": [
              "Cartier watchmakers have created a jewellery-inspired aesthetic enhanced by the emblematic Clou de Paris motif. This innovative adventure pushes creative boundaries through an unprecedented expression of expertise.",
              "Cartier master jewellers give each piece all its lustre during the polishing phase. Carried out entirely by hand, this finishing stage requires the utmost precision."
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "videoBlock",
            "media": {
              "url": "/videos/productPages/baignoire-and-Myst/videoBlock.mp4",
              "type": "video",
              "ariaLabel": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "productsBlock",
            "medias": [
              {
                "url": "/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/productsBlock1.webp",
                "ariaLabel": ""
              },
              {
                "url": "/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/productsBlock2.webp",
                "ariaLabel": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "scrollMediasBlock",
            "text": "Myst de Cartier is a watch with a singular aesthetic, resolutely in the creative vein. The mystery takes shape through its surprising construction. It has no clasp, bringing to mind a trompe-l'œil bracelet. Strung together like beads, the elements that make it up resemble protective talismans.",
            "medias": [
              {
                "url": "/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock1-2.webp",
                "ariaLabel": "",
                "subtitle": ""
              },
              {
                "url": "/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock2-2.webp",
                "ariaLabel": "",
                "subtitle": "A sculpture of a watch"
              },
              {
                "url": "/images/productPages/baignoire-and-myst/scrollMediasBlock3-2.webp",
                "ariaLabel": "",
                "subtitle": "The link between jewellery and watchmaking"
              },
              {
